{{Velious Era}}
In the second gorge made by [[Veeshan]] the dragons built the great '''Temple of Veeshan''' where they perpetually worship their mother who deposited the first brood there eons ago. This giant temple is home to some of the mightiest dragons of Velious. The south (entrance) and west wings are aligned with the [[Claws of Veeshan]] and thus safe assuming you are an ally. In the east wing are the testing halls with aggressive dragonkin, while in the north are the Guardians of Veeshan who protect the sacred halls against trespass of non-dragonkin.

Level 46+ is REQUIRED to enter this zone.
