== Dangers ==

*While the '''one-way''' zone-in location is 99% safe, regardless of faction, those who are KoS to [[Claws of Veeshan]] '''do not''' have a safe run to an exit and must either; get a CoTH to an exit, TL/Port, or Gate.

*[[a shimmer drake]] will mass dispel raid forces

*Some of the named dragons are perma-rooted adding difficulty

Additional guides can be found here:

East TOV - [[HOT Mobs Guide]]

North TOV - [[NTOV Flurries]]

