*Outside of [[Sleeper's Tomb]], items that drop from this zone represent some of the best obtainable in Velious.

*Holds some of the best quested items outlined in [[Dozekar Tear Quests]] if you are friendly with [[Claws of Veeshan]].

== Traveling To and From ==

*The entrance to ToV is a clickable tower found behind [[Sontalak]] in [[Western Wastes]] at (+700, +700).  The entrance is '''one-way''' and the only way in.

*To leave ToV you must reach the exit in the West Wing ([[Claws of Veeshan]] friendly) or get a CoTH to an exit, TL/Port, Gate. Additional exits exist in the East and North wings.

*The clickable house is the '''one-way''' entrance to the [[Plane of Mischief]] and is located deep within the North Wing.

